# generated by build_judge.py — rebuild it, don't version it (it embeds the
# eval's clip/segment text inline, a few MB; the frame JPEGs it references
# stay in ../bundle/, itself gitignored, so committing judge.html alone
# wouldn't even be openable on a fresh checkout without also fetching those)
judge.html

# a judge's personal progress + votes: browser localStorage, and whatever a
# human exports/imports by hand. Keep your own copy wherever you keep review
# notes — this directory is the tool, not the judging session.
verdicts*.json
verdicts.md
__pycache__/
